          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes Boka fluoride-free toothpaste different from traditional fluoride toothpaste?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Boka offers a fluoride-free toothpaste formulated with nano-hydroxyapatite, a mineral-based ingredient studied for its use in modern dental products. Unlike traditional fluoride formulas, Boka’s approach emphasizes natural ingredients such as xylitol, green tea, and plant-based extracts while remaining SLS-free. This makes it a popular product choice for adults looking to reduce buildup through consistent brushing without added fluoride. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "63654bb1-5b66-4184-b74e-96afc7dd589d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is fluoride-free toothpaste suitable for daily use on teeth?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, Boka’s fluoride-free toothpaste for teeth is designed for consistent use as part of a daily routine, typically twice a day with regular brushing. The formulas are crafted to support and maintain a clean mouth using naturally derived ingredients. Dentists often recommend choosing a toothpaste based on personal needs, and Boka provides a wide range of fluoride-free options to support a refreshed smile, a clean feeling, and long-term routine consistency.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15161032212523__87fe4551-6f72-4fad-a167-9333db3df7ec-collapsible_row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this toothpaste safe for sensitive teeth?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>By sealing exposed dentin tubules, n-Ha offers soothing relief without harsh chemicals. Added peppermint flavor provides a cool, fresh finish that sensitive users like.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15161032212523__87fe4551-6f72-4fad-a167-9333db3df7ec-collapsible_row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How often should I use this toothpaste for best results?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>For optimal results, use this toothpaste at least twice daily, brushing for two minutes each time. Consistent use helps prevent new lesions and maintains a naturally bright whitening effect.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "template--15161032212523__87fe4551-6f72-4fad-a167-9333db3df7ec-collapsible_row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can children use this toothpaste?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, this fluoride-free toothpaste with n-Ha is safe for children. However, always supervise young children while brushing and encourage them to use an appropriate amount of toothpaste.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "613af9d2-de07-48e6-9e79-31740c728cae": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
